   "he": "רַבִּי אֱלִיעֶזֶר אוֹמֵר: הֲרֵי זֶה עֶבֶד מַמְזֵר. אָמַר רַבִּי אֶלְעָזָר: מַאי טַעְמֵיהּ דְּרַבִּי אֱלִיעֶזֶר – דְּאָמַר קְרָא: ״לוֹ״ – הַלֵּךְ אַחַר פְּסוּלוֹ.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that «Rabbi Eliezer says: This» son «is a mamzer slave. Rabbi Elazar said: What is the reason of Rabbi Eliezer? As the verse states» with regard to a mamzer: “Even to the tenth generation none «of his» shall enter the assembly of the Lord” (Deuteronomy 23:3), which indicates that in the case of the child of a mamzer and a Canaanite maidservant, one «follows his» parent with the «flawed» lineage, and the child is a mamzer."
  }
 ],
